From 37a5d1e87bd89074cfd1686d3e05668e10db4e53 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:18:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 59/64] Agents panel: summaries behind an info button instead
 of on hover

The AI summary popover opened whenever the pointer rested on a row and
covered the view. A row now shows an info button while hovered; clicking it
shows or hides that row's summary, which also closes when the pointer
leaves the list or the context menu opens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
